✖️ Multiplication Table Generator

A beginner-friendly Python program that generates a multiplication table for any number entered by the user.
Unlike a fixed 1–10 table, this program allows the user to choose the range and generate multiple multiplication tables without restarting the program.

📌 Features
🔢 Accepts a number from the user
✖️ Generates its multiplication table
🔢 Allows the user to choose the table range
🔄 Supports multiple table generations
🚪 Allows the user to quit by entering q
📊 Displays the multiplication results clearly


🧠 Concepts Used

This project helped me practice:

