break
Arithmetic operators
User input handling


⚙️ How It Works

The program follows these steps:

Displays the Multiplication Table Generator heading.
Asks the user to enter a number.
The user can enter q to quit.
Asks the user to enter the desired range.


Converts the inputs into integers.

Uses a for loop to generate the multiplication table.
Prints the result for every number from 1 up to the selected range.
Repeats the process so the user can generate another table.
Stops when the user enters q.

